From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] region: Formats in one column

Plinius: the dialog relies on a breakpoint for its narrow layout. Dialogs open as pages here
(cc-plinius-dialog-pages.c), so the content leaves the dialog that holds the breakpoint, and on a
phone the list stayed next to the preview with its names cut off. Always use the narrow layout:
one column, and the preview button in each row opens the preview over it.
---
 panels/system/region/cc-format-chooser.blp | 11 ++---------
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/panels/system/region/cc-format-chooser.blp b/panels/system/region/cc-format-chooser.blp
--- a/panels/system/region/cc-format-chooser.blp
+++ b/panels/system/region/cc-format-chooser.blp
@@ -9,14 +9,6 @@ template $CcFormatChooser: Adw.Dialog {
   height-request: 200;
   focus-widget: region_filter_entry;
 
-  Adw.Breakpoint {
-    condition ("max-width: 550sp")
-
-    setters {
-      split_view.collapsed: true;
-    }
-  }
-
   child: Adw.ToolbarView {
     top-bar-style: raised;
 
@@ -48,6 +40,8 @@ template $CcFormatChooser: Adw.Dialog {
 
     content: Adw.OverlaySplitView split_view {
       sidebar-position: end;
+      collapsed: true;
+      show-sidebar: false;
       notify::collapsed => $collapsed_cb(template);
 
       content: Adw.ToolbarView {
